# Cloudflare Pages Redirects Configuration
# https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/

# API Proxy - 转发所有API请求到Render后端
# 注意：Cloudflare Pages的_redirects不支持:splat，使用*代替
/api/* https://web3search-api.onrender.com/api/v1/:splat 200

# Health check endpoint
/health https://web3search-api.onrender.com/health 200

# API Documentation
/docs https://web3search-api.onrender.com/docs 200
/openapi.json https://web3search-api.onrender.com/openapi.json 200

# SPA Fallback - 所有其他路由返回index.html
/* /index.html 200
